[node name="MarginContainer2_VBoxContainer_MarginContainer_Panel#PanelContainer" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer2/VBoxContainer/MarginContainer/Control/MarginContainer2_VBoxContainer_MarginContainer_Panel#PanelContainer" index="0"]
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
fit_content = true
text = "[center]
[b]HOW TO PLAY[/b]


[b]GOLD[/b]
Each faction starts with 10 gold.
Your treasury grows by 5 gold every second.
Deploy Miners to gold mines to gather extra income for your side.


[b]SPAWNING UNITS[/b]
Click a unit portrait in the HUD to select it.
Then click on the battlefield to deploy the unit.
Each unit costs gold from your treasury:
Warrior 5  ·  Archer 10  ·  Heavy 15  ·  Miner 20  ·  Special 30
You can only deploy on your side of the map, not right next to your own castle.


[b]WINNING THE BATTLE[/b]
Destroy the enemy castle to claim VICTORY.
If your castle falls first, DEFEAT is yours.
[/center]"
